From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 06:56:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show the specific block type in the Quick Add button label

Changes the button text from generic "Quick Add" to "Add <Type>" (e.g.
"Add Reverse Proxy", "Add Static Site") using the label already
computed for the tooltip, so the button communicates what it will
create at a glance.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GdhKf193j6ggwAGFYCUaJg
---
 templates/partials/quick_add_button.html | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/templates/partials/quick_add_button.html b/templates/partials/quick_add_button.html
index c9d191e..d1c1346 100644
--- a/templates/partials/quick_add_button.html
+++ b/templates/partials/quick_add_button.html
@@ -42,7 +42,7 @@
         <path d="M18 19a2 2 0 0 0 2 -2v-4l1 -1l-1 -1v-4a2 2 0 0 0 -2 -2" />
       </svg>
     {% endif %}
-    Quick Add
+    Add {{ qa_label }}
   </a>
 {% endif %}
 <!-- END QUICK ADD BUTTON -->
